<body lang=EN-IN style='tab-interval:36.0pt;word-wrap:break-word;margin-left:
72.0pt;margin-top:72.0pt;margin-right:72.0pt;margin-bottom:72.0pt'>

<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=subtitle style='margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:16.0pt;
margin-left:72.0pt'><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>AEM as Cloud
Service ·&nbsp; Groovy Console<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1A3A6B 2.25pt;
padding:0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm'>

<h1><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Andrew
Forms — Migration &amp; Cleanup<o:p></o:p></span></h1>

</div>

<p class=subtitle style='margin-top:4.0pt'><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>Automated
removal of legacy &quot;<span class=SpellE>andrew</span>&quot; folder hierarchy
across SP Global BUs<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:20.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center'><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#1A1A1A'>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><!-- BACKGROUND -->1.
Background &amp; Problem<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<div style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;padding:10.0pt 14.0pt 10.0pt 14.0pt;
margin-top:10.0pt;margin-bottom:10.0pt'>

<p style='background:#F7FAFC'><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:
"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>Problem:</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>
Multiple BUs had Adaptive Forms and DAM assets nested inside folders whose name
contained <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>&quot;<span
class=SpellE>andrew</span>&quot;</span></strong> (e.g. </span><span
class=mono1><span style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
color:#1A1A1A'>energy/forms/<span class=SpellE>andrew-en</span>/contact-form</span></span><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>).
These were legacy staging folders never cleaned up. Pages across SP Global
referenced these paths directly, making a simple folder delete unsafe.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

</div>

<p><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>The
migration needed to be <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>automated</span></strong>
(nearly <span class=GramE>100 page</span> references across the site), <strong><span
style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>safe</span></strong> (dry-run mode
before applying), and <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>per-BU</span></strong>
due to AEM Cloud dev environment instability on large-scope runs.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:20.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center'><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#1A1A1A'>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><!-- WHAT CHANGED -->2.
What Changed<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<h3><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'>Form
Location — Before &amp; After<o:p></o:p></span></h3>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%"
 style='width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184'>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes'>
  <td style='background:#2D3748;padding:6.0pt 10.0pt 6.0pt 10.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  14.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><b><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:white'>Before (old path)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td style='background:#2D3748;padding:6.0pt 10.0pt 6.0pt 10.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
  14.0pt;margin-left:0cm'><b><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:white'>After (new path)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
