<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><!-- HOW IT WORKS -->4.
How It Works — Migration Steps<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=3 cellpadding=0 width="100%"
 style='width:100.0%;mso-cellspacing:1.5pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184'>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes'>
  <td width=37 valign=top style='width:28.0pt;border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;
  background:#2B6CB0;padding:8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
  margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center'><b><span
  style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
  color:white'>1<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #E2E8F0 1.0pt;
  padding:8.0pt 12.0pt 8.0pt 12.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:4.0pt;mso-outline-level:4'><b><span
  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#2C5282'>Discovery<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  color:#1A1A1A'>Recursively walks both AF and DAM trees per BU. When a node
  with &quot;<span class=SpellE>andrew</span>&quot; in its name is found it
  distinguishes <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>folders</span></strong>
  (has child form nodes → move the children) from <strong><span
  style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>forms</span></strong> (the node
  itself is the form, e.g. </span><span class=SpellE><span class=mono1><span
  style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#1A1A1A'>andrew</span></span></span><span
  class=mono1><span style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
  color:#1A1A1A'>-test-form</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
  font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'> → move the node). Builds a
  move map of old path → new path at BU root.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:1'>
  <td width=37 valign=top style='width:28.0pt;border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;
  background:#2B6CB0;padding:8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span
  style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
  color:white'>2<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #E2E8F0 1.0pt;
  padding:8.0pt 12.0pt 8.0pt 12.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:4.0pt;mso-outline-level:4'><b><span
  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#2C5282'>Move Forms<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  color:#1A1A1A'>Executes </span><span class=SpellE><span class=GramE><span
  class=mono1><span style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
  color:#1A1A1A'>session.move</span></span></span></span><span class=mono1><span
  style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#1A1A1A'>(<span
  class=SpellE>src</span>, <span class=SpellE>dst</span>)</span></span><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'> for
  each discovered form. Skips gracefully if destination already exists. Saves
  to the JCR after all moves complete.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:2'>
  <td width=37 valign=top style='width:28.0pt;border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;
  background:#2B6CB0;padding:8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span
  style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
  color:white'>3<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #E2E8F0 1.0pt;
  padding:8.0pt 12.0pt 8.0pt 12.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:4.0pt;mso-outline-level:4'><b><span
  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#2C5282'>Delete Empty Andrew Folders<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  color:#1A1A1A'>After forms are moved, <span class=SpellE>andrew</span>
  folders are checked for remaining children. Empty folders are removed with </span><span
  class=SpellE><span class=GramE><span class=mono1><span style='font-size:9.5pt;
  mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#1A1A1A'>node.remove</span></span></span></span><span
  class=mono1><span style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
  color:#1A1A1A'>()</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
  "Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:3;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes'>
  <td width=37 valign=top style='width:28.0pt;border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;
  background:#2B6CB0;padding:8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt 8.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span
  style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
  color:white'>4<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  </td>
  <td valign=top style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #E2E8F0 1.0pt;
  padding:8.0pt 12.0pt 8.0pt 12.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:4.0pt;mso-outline-level:4'><b><span
  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";color:#2C5282'>Update Content References<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;
  color:#1A1A1A'>Does a <strong><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif'>manual
  JCR tree walk</span></strong> (no SQL2 query — avoids the 100k node traversal
  limit on AEM Cloud) over </span><span class=mono1><span style='font-size:
  9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#1A1A1A'>/content/<span
  class=SpellE>spglobal</span>/{BU}</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
  font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>. Checks every node for the
  known ref properties and rewrites any that pointed to old DAM paths.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
</table>

<div style='border:solid #CBD5E0 1.0pt;padding:10.0pt 14.0pt 10.0pt 14.0pt;
margin-top:10.0pt;margin-bottom:10.0pt'>

<p style='background:#F7FAFC'><strong><span style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:
"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>Why per-BU execution?</span></strong><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'> AEM as
Cloud Service dev environment returned intermittent errors on <span
class=GramE>large-scope</span> runs. The </span><span class=mono1><span
style='font-size:9.5pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:#1A1A1A'>TARGET_BU</span></span><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A'>
variable lets you run one BU at a time, isolating failures and keeping each run
fast and recoverable.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

</div>

<div class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:20.0pt;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:20.0pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:center'><span style='font-size:
11.0pt;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:#1A1A1A'>

<hr size=2 width="100%" align=center>

</span></div>

<h2><span style='font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><!-- QA -->5.
QA &amp; Validation<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

